              "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Match the order total to the screenshot**\n\nThe order figure displays `899 USD` for both total fields, while this paragraph states `USD 89.90`; the Spanish paragraph repeats the same mismatch. Readers using the example to identify which values to report therefore receive contradictory information, so update both translations or use an asset containing the stated amount.\n\nUseful? React with \ud83d\udc4d\u00a0/ \ud83d\udc4e.",
