            {
              "id": "PRRC_kwDOIVbAxs74D811",
              "body": "I inspected all four exact-head native PNGs at original resolution. Both total fields display `89.9 USD`, including the decimal point, rather than `899 USD`. This is numerically the same amount as the prose's `USD 89.90`. The retained read-only serializer evidence at `docs/editorial-work/captures/orders-with-api/fixture-readonly.json` independently records `total.amount: \"89.9\"`, `converted_amount: \"89.9\"`, USD, and two items at 44.95 each. The approved English desktop asset SHA256 is `b728ba41fdd9c004408a7153f0f8f9a0bfc6634d0d9e44485db3dfc7b120b08b`; the Spanish desktop asset is `ce7071cd6129d589df554b45f6ead105ef20ce3b1b4eeaf6eace613f34b4bb00`. Preview checks confirmed all four assets are unchanged and match their approved source hashes. The stated mismatch is not present, so no article or screenshot alteration is warranted.",
