              "id": "PRRC_kwDOIVbAxs74EBnE",
              "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Direct Spanish readers to the localized contact form**\n\nThe primary instruction sends Spanish readers to `/contact/`, which the retained evidence confirms remains the English form with options such as \u201cI need help.\u201d Consequently, readers following this instruction will not see the Spanish labels described later in the same sentence, even though `/contacto` is already verified as the localized form; use that URL for the primary new-request link.\n\nUseful? React with \ud83d\udc4d\u00a0/ \ud83d\udc4e.",
              "url": "https://github.com/hellotext/help/pull/355#discussion_r4161804740",
